(UFDBGUARD - BACKUP RETENTION / OPERATING PROCEDURE) Tj
T* (Document version: 2026-11-17 | Public sanitized edition) Tj
T* (Purpose: retain 3 most recent backups; preserve active blacklists;) Tj
T* (run dry-run before deletion; timer at 04:30.) Tj
T* (CAUTION: Deletes historical backup folders. Coordinate a shared lock) Tj
T* (with 20-fetch-ut1.sh for guaranteed updater/cleanup mutual exclusion.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (=== README.md ===) Tj
T* (# ufdbGuard backup cleanup) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Retains the three most recent `blacklists.bak.YYYY-MM-DD-HHMMSS` directories under `/var/lib/ufdbguard`.) Tj
T* ( Protects the active `blacklists` directory. Designed for a Linux host using Squid and ufdbGuard.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Install) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (```bash) Tj
T* (sudo install -o root -g root -m 0750 ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.sh /usr/local/sbin/ufdbguard-backup-cleanu) Tj
T* (p.sh) Tj
T* (sudo install -o root -g root -m 0644 ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.service /etc/systemd/system/) Tj
T* (sudo install -o root -g root -m 0644 ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.timer /etc/systemd/system/) Tj
T* (sudo bash -n /usr/local/sbin/ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.sh) Tj
T* (sudo /usr/local/sbin/ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.sh --dry-run) Tj
T* (```) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Inspect the simulated deletion list before the first real run. Then:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (```bash) Tj
T* (sudo /usr/local/sbin/ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.sh) Tj
T* (sudo systemctl daemon-reload) Tj
T* (sudo systemctl enable --now ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.timer) Tj
T* (sudo systemctl list-timers --all | grep ufdbguard-backup-cleanup) Tj
T* (sudo journalctl -u ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.service -n 100 --no-pager) Tj
T* (df -h /var) Tj
T* (```) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Operational limitations) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- Cleanup is destructive and historical backups cannot be recovered without separate backups.) Tj
T* (- The updater process check is best-effort only. **Implement a shared lock in the updater before relying) Tj
T* ( on race-free automation.**) Tj
T* (- The script expects the ufdbGuard data directory to reside on the `/var` mount; change the mount assert) Tj
T* (ion for other layouts.) Tj
T* (- `Persistent=true` may trigger a missed timer run immediately when enabled.) Tj
T* (- No Squid or ufdbGuard restart is performed.) Tj
T* (- Review the `systemd` timer separately if updater duration can exceed 04:30.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## Files) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- `ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.sh`: cleanup and dry-run.) Tj
T* (- `ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.service`: systemd oneshot.) Tj
T* (- `ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.timer`: daily at 04:30.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* () Tj
T* (=== ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.sh ===) Tj
T* (#!/usr/bin/env bash) Tj
T* (set -Eeuo pipefail) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (BASE='/var/lib/ufdbguard') Tj
T* (ACTIVE="$BASE/blacklists") Tj
T* (KEEP=3) Tj
T* (LOCK='/run/ufdbguard-backup-cleanup.lock') Tj
T* (MODE="${1:-}") Tj
T* () Tj
T* (log\(\) { printf '%s [ufdb-cleanup] %s\\n' "$\(date '+%F %T'\)" "$*"; }) Tj
T* () Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
